# 4. CORE GAMEPLAY AND PLAYER MOVEMENT

Create a 2D top-down maze game.

The player must be able to move through open maze pathways but must never pass through solid walls or blocked obstacles.

Desktop controls:

- W / Up Arrow: Move up.
- S / Down Arrow: Move down.
- A / Left Arrow: Move left.
- D / Right Arrow: Move right.
